WEBVTT

00:01:27.871 --> 00:01:30.499
and what we all collectively
can do about it.

00:01:31.212 --> 00:01:32.405
Let's dive in.

00:01:32.429 --> 00:01:33.579
(Music)

00:01:37.777 --> 00:01:39.792
Adam, welcome to the TED Interview.

00:01:39.816 --> 00:01:41.499
