this isn't such a big deal,

00:01:53.953 --> 00:01:56.487
there's a relatively tiny number of cases.

00:01:56.511 --> 00:01:58.903
Compare it to the flu,
compare it to anything else.

00:01:58.927 --> 00:02:01.014
